{
  "batch_id": "s1:batch:0008",
  "translations": [
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00514",
      "en": "The shop woman",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00515",
      "en": "Welcome.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00517",
      "en": "A woman's bright voice greets us as we step inside.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00519",
      "en": "The shop woman",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00520",
      "en": "Two of you? That seat is free.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00522",
      "en": "She looks around the nearly full lunchtime shop,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00523",
      "en": "The shop woman at the counter pointed to",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00524",
      "en": "two empty seats.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00531",
      "en": "Um, excuse me, is the owner of this shop...?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00537",
      "en": "The shop woman",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00538",
      "en": "Being called 'Master' is a bit embarrassing, but",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00539",
      "en": "That's me.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00546",
      "en": "Ah, s-sorry!",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00552",
      "en": "The shopkeeper",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00553",
      "en": "Hehe, you don't have to apologize.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00554",
      "en": "So, what do you need from me?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00561",
      "en": "Ah, no, um, do you have a room available?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00567",
      "en": "The shopkeeper",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00568",
      "en": "You're lodging guests? Then come to the counter.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00575",
      "en": "Yes.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00577",
      "en": "When we come to the empty seats at the counter,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00578",
      "en": "The shopkeeper, behind counter, pulls out a ledger.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00579",
      "en": "and turns to face us.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00585",
      "en": "The shopkeeper",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00586",
      "en": "I forgot to introduce myself. I'm Rinsha.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00587",
      "en": "And what are your names?",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00594",
      "en": "Yes, this is Lord Celica Silfil,",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00595",
      "en": "and I am his servant, Shuri.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00602",
      "en": "A servant? Your clothes do show that.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00609",
      "en": "Yes.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00611",
      "en": "Smoothly, Rinsha writes our names into the ledger.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00618",
      "en": "So, a room? A double room is free.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00625",
      "en": "N-no, not at all.",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00626",
      "en": "Um, separate rooms...",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "line_id": "s1:00632",
      "en": "Rinsha tilts her head at Shuri's fluster.",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ],
